# Lab 03 – Machine Learning Workflow and Types of Learning

## Overview
This lab introduced the basic machine learning workflow and the main types of machine learning.

## What I Learned
- How a machine learning project is structured
- The difference between supervised and unsupervised learning
- How models use data to make predictions or find patterns

## Tools Used
- Python
- Google Colab
- scikit-learn

## Reflection
This lab helped me understand the overall process of machine learning before going deeper into specific models and techniques.
